<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>Setup complete · Acme</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="&#x2f;t&#x2f;acme&#x2f;assets/anvil.css">
</head>
<body>

<main id="main" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
<p class="anvil-tenant">Acme</p>
<h1 id="page-heading">Setup complete</h1>

<p class="anvil-lead">The administrator account <strong id="admin-email">admin@example.test</strong> has been created.</p>
<p>Next, sign in to the admin console with the administrator account to create your first app.</p>
<nav class="anvil-links" aria-label="Next steps">
<a id="link-console" href="https:&#x2f;&#x2f;op.test&#x2f;console&#x2f;">Open the admin console</a>
</nav>
<section id="setup-automation" aria-labelledby="setup-automation-heading">
<h2 id="setup-automation-heading">For automation</h2>
<p>Scripts and CI pipelines can call the admin API with these management credentials.</p>
<div class="anvil-callout anvil-callout-warning" role="note">
<p><strong>Copy these credentials now.</strong> The client secret is shown only once and cannot be displayed again.</p>
</div>
<dl class="anvil-credentials">
<dt>Management client ID</dt>
<dd><code id="mgmt-client-id">mgmt-123</code></dd>
<dt>Management client secret</dt>
<dd><code id="mgmt-client-secret">secret-shown-once</code></dd>
<dt>Token endpoint</dt>
<dd><code id="token-endpoint">https:&#x2f;&#x2f;op.test&#x2f;t&#x2f;system&#x2f;token</code></dd>
<dt>Admin API base</dt>
<dd><code id="admin-api-base">https:&#x2f;&#x2f;op.test&#x2f;api&#x2f;admin&#x2f;v1</code></dd>
</dl>
<p class="anvil-muted">Use the client ID and secret with the client credentials grant at the token endpoint to call the admin API.</p>
</section>

</main>
</body>
</html>
